  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2401\">\n<li data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2120\">\n<p data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1977\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1975\">Normal (Donor Engraftment):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2120\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2069\">\n<p data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2069\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2013\">Karyotype matches donor sex</strong> (e.g., 46,XX for female donor, 46,XY for male donor).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2120\">\n<p data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2120\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2094\">&gt;95% donor cells</strong> = successful engraftment.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2258\">\n<p data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2157\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2155\">Mixed Chimerism or Relapse:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2258\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2258\">\n<p data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2258\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Presence of <strong data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2215\">recipient karyotype or abnormal clone</strong> may indicate <strong data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2257\">graft failure or relapse</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2401\">\n<p data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2294\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2292\">Chromosomal Abnormalities:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2401\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2401\">\n<p data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2401\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Any new clonal abnormalities must be documented in <strong data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2365\">ISCN format</strong> and correlated with disease status.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
